# Tayam, Luminous Enigma's "each other creature you control enters with an additional vigilance counter on it" and Walking
# Ballista's own "enters with X +1/+1 counters on it" both modify how the Ballista enters (CR 614.1c, 614.12): Bot1, its
# controller, is asked which applies first (CR 616.1), and answers Tayam's. Each still applies once after the other
# (CR 616.1f): the Ballista enters with its +1/+1 counter and the vigilance counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Tayam, Luminous Enigma
Walking Ballista
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

